=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to Rasdinice.
* Travel to the Fortilace at {z:Batallia Downs (S)} (D-6) (Far left side of the map.)
** Survival Guide warp recommended.
* Once the party leader has selected to enter, you will be transported into {z:Everbloom Hollow}.
* A party of 3 Orc Stormers, RNG PLD WAR, will be roaming the area.
* Once all three orcs are defeated, the Mission Objective is complete. Exit via the Dawn Aureola.
* Return and talk to Rasdinice for your reward.

=2 Notes
* There seems to be no time limit to how long you can take to get to Everbloom Hollow.
* All 3 of the Orc are sleepable.
* The orc are very weak.
** Approximately 1800 HP each.

